From: ImpulseROM <noreply@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Disable DualAP support

SPF_SupportMobileApDualAp=false (Note10+ Wi-Fi stack has no dual-band hotspot).
The old is5GhzBandSupported hunk is gone: that method no longer exists in One UI 8.5 DZF3.
---
 smali/com/android/settings/Utils.smali | changed
 1 file changed

--- a/smali/com/android/settings/Utils.smali
+++ b/smali/com/android/settings/Utils.smali
@@ -111,7 +111,7 @@
 
     sput-boolean v2, Lcom/android/settings/Utils;->SPF_SupportMobileApEnhanced:Z
 
-    sput-boolean v2, Lcom/android/settings/Utils;->SPF_SupportMobileApDualAp:Z
+    sput-boolean v1, Lcom/android/settings/Utils;->SPF_SupportMobileApDualAp:Z
 
     sput-boolean v2, Lcom/android/settings/Utils;->SPF_SupportInstantHotspot:Z
 
